WEBVTT

00:02:30.121 --> 00:02:33.246
Simultaneously, every person interprets
the message they receive

00:02:33.288 --> 00:02:35.996
based on their relationship
with the other person,

00:02:36.038 --> 00:02:37.496
and their unique understanding

00:02:37.538 --> 00:02:41.954
of the semantics and connotations
of the exact words being used.

00:02:42.496 --> 00:02:45.038
They could also be distracted
by other stimuli,

00:02:45.079 --> 00:02:47.663
such as traffic
or a growling stomach.

00:02:47.704 --> 00:02:50.663
Even emotion might cloud
their understanding,

00:02:50.704 --> 00:02:53.329
and by adding more people
into a conversation,

00:02:53.371 --> 00:02:55.579
each with their own subjectivities,

00:02:55.621 --> 00:02:58.913
the complexity of communication
grows exponentially.

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:03.038
So as the lump of clay goes back and forth
from one person to another,